19	// response formats:
20	//
21	//	one metric name "requests" in service "svc", window
22	//	[2026-10-01T10:00:00Z, 10:03:00Z) with three one-minute segments.
23	//	Series a=1 and a=2 exist with one in-window point each; one batch
24	//	supplements both, creates previously absent series a=3, and carries late
25	//	historical samples (one earlier than a=1's stored predecessor, one that
26	//	becomes a=2's first predecessor), plus a point per existing series exactly
27	//	at the query end, which is excluded. The batch is sent shuffled, so
28	//	predecessor and delta correctness must follow sample time, never body
29	//	order. Pre- and post-batch grand totals both equal 100 while every
30	//	per-series/per-segment vector changes, so only a whole-state comparison
31	//	can catch a splice.
